        <updated>2026-03-09T10:45:46.666Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<div class="Story_container"><div class="Story_data"><div class="Story_title"><a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47300329"><span>Ask HN: Please restrict new accounts from posting</span></a></div><div class="Story_meta"><span><a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47300329">654 points</a></span><span class="Story_separator">|</span><span><a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=Oras"><span>Oras</span></a></span><span class="Story_separator">|</span><span><a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47300329">22 hours ago</a></span><span class="Story_separator">|</span><span><a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47300329">466 comments</a></span><div class="Story_comment"><span>I don’t know if I’m the only one, but I see lots of clearly AI generated posts recently in HN and mostly coming from new accounts (green), it is more noticeable in the Show HN section.<p>I wish the team can either restrict new accounts from posting or at least offer a default filtering where I can only see posts from accounts with certain criteria.</p><p>I don’t want to see HN becoming twitter, which is full of bots and noise, as this would be a really sad day.</p></span></div></div></div></div>]]></content>
